:: Fishing Moor Catch
<<effects>>
<<if ["sit", "campfire"].includes($daily.fishing.moor.hikers.phase)>>
	<<fishingMoorCaughtHikers>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.moor.fox.phase is "watching">>
	<<fishingMoorCaughtFox>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingMoorCaught>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Reel
<<effects>>
<<set $fishingReelAttempts += 1>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	You brace against the rocks and heave, and you <<if $fishingReelAttempts gt 1>>finally<</if>> <span class="green">reel up the fish.</span><<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<include "Fishing Moor Catch">>
<<elseif $fishingReelAttempts gte 3 and $rng gte 80>>
	<<if $daily.fishing.moor.fox.phase is "watching">>
		<<fishingMoorLineSnappedFox>>
	<<elseif ["sit", "campfire"].includes($daily.fishing.moor.hikers.phase) and !(playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant())>>
		<<fishingMoorLineSnappedHikers>>
	<<else>>
		<<fishingMoorLineSnapped>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $fishingReelAttempts is 1>>
		You haul back on your rod, but the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> strips your line right back off the reel. Your arms burn with the effort.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
	<<else>>
		You drag it closer, close enough to see it thrash between the reeds, before it dives again, nearly wrenching your rod from your hands.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<set _reelDifficultyMax to Math.clamp($fishingHookedFish.size * 10, 600, 1400)>>
	<<link [[Keep fighting it|Fishing Moor Reel]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty -250 _reelDifficultyMax>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Cut the line|Fishing Moor Cut Line]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Cut Line
<<effects>>
You release the tension on your rod, letting your line go slack. The <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> pulls harder, and with a sudden snap, your line breaks free. Through the ripples, you catch a glimpse of it darting deeper, finally free.
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Widgets Fishing Moor Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingMoorCaught">>
	<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
	<<run updateFishRecord($fishingHookedFish.type, $fishingHookedFish.size, $bus)>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set _fishPropName to "caught-" + $fishingHookedFish.type>>
	<<wearProp _fishPropName>>

	<<fishingCatchFishText $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Moor Keep]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [["Throw the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " back"|Fishing Moor Throw Back]]>><</link>>
	<<if _canEatFish>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Moor Cat Eat]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingMoorLineSnapped">>
	Your line <span class="red">snaps,</span> suddenly going slack as the fish disappears into the murk.
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>
